# Whitelist the two VideoTestimonials review videos — they're served
# from /public/videos/ and need to be in the deploy. The blanket *.mp4
# rule above stays so future bulk video content (promo reels, course
# clips) doesn't accidentally bloat the repo without a deliberate add.
!public/videos/review-1.mp4
!public/videos/review-2-720p.mp4
!public/videos/review-3.mp4

